      ranges: [['Within about 15%', 'Consistent', ''], ['More than 30% apart', 'Explain the gap', 'Usually growth, margins or WACC']],
      why: 'The two methods answer different questions: what is it worth on its own cash flows, and what would the market pay for similar businesses. A big gap tells you where to look.',
