      steps: ['Read the "Debt" note in the 10-K for the size of the credit facility and its interest rate.', 'Set a minimum cash balance (a few weeks of costs, or 2–5% of revenue).', 'The model draws on the revolver when cash would fall below the minimum and repays it with spare cash.', 'Interest on average balances creates a loop (circularity); the model handles it with an iterative or opening-balance method.'],
